  "answer": "Project Zenith is a cloud storage optimization initiative led by Marcus Cole, launching in Q3 2023 with a kickoff on July 15th. The team has expanded to include five new members specializing in cybersecurity, cloud architecture, machine learning, and cloud computing, with onboarding sessions scheduled for September 10th and April 15th, 2023. Key updates include a budget increase to $55,000 for compliance and $15,000 for training, new security protocols effective January next year, and ongoing feedback collection on the prototype. Additionally, the team is exploring a partnership with TechInnovate for AI technology and is awaiting confirmation of a detailed competitive assessment."
